    // tens of thousands ("23400.00") and is unreadable as a battery current.
    // The two summed groups -- and ONLY those two -- are divided by 1000 and
    // labelled (A).
    //
    // The division happens once, where the merged series is produced, rather
    // than in each renderer: the pivot table, the report export and the graph
    // all read that same parsed.attributeData entry, so converting at the
    // source is the only way they cannot disagree. Individual IIPS attributes
    // are untouched and stay in mA.
